USERID   DS    CL8                     To receive UserID                00056600
STAR     DS    C                       To contain an asterisk           00056700
DFLTGRP  DS    CL8                     To receive default Group name    00056800
SPECIAL  DS    C                       Y or N for SPECIAL               00056900
OPER     DS    C                       Y or N for OPERATIONS            00057000
WORKPASS DS    CL9                     1 byte length + password         00057100
