DCBCOMP  DS    H                       Completion code in DCBABEND      00057300
*                                                                       00057400
         DS    0F                                                       00057500
HASHWKD  DS    0CL772                  Area for RAKFPWH                 00057600
HWPL     DS    5F                    parmlist (salt,pw,pwlen,out,work)  00057700
HWPWLEN  DS    F                       Candidate password length        00057800
HWR13    DS    F                       saved caller save-area pointer   00057900
HWOUT    DS    CL32                    computed SHA-256 hash            00058000
HWSAVE   DS    18F                     save area for the RAKFPWH call   00058100
HWWORK   DS    CL640                   RAKFPWH work area (>= RPWWORKL)  00058200
